# Typechain output, at the root only. Same reason as /deployments/: a source directory named
# types anywhere under frontend or lib is entirely plausible, and would vanish silently.
/types/
# Hardhat's deployment artefacts, at the repository root only. Unanchored, this pattern
# matches any directory of that name at any depth — it silently swallowed the
# frontend/app/docs/deployments route, which then 404'd in production while building fine
# locally, because the file was on disk and simply never committed.
/deployments/
tmp

